<title>USA: TABLE - Enron Corp sells $150 mln notes.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Enron Corp sells $150 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Enron Corp was priced on Monday, according to lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p>Enron Corp is an integrated natural gas and electricity company.</p>
<p>BORROWER ENRON CORP</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 6.50 PCT   MATURITY 8/1/2002</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.901  FIRST PAY DATE 2/1/1998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD 6.524 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  SPREAD +41 BPS    CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>((  Caryn Trokie, U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1678 ))</p>
</text>
